# Canonical identity for this repository.
#
# GitHub attributes a commit by e-mail address, not by the name string. The
# address `feylo@users.noreply.github.com` belongs to the GitHub account named
# `feylo` (id 19762460) — a different person who registered that username in
# 2016. This project is by `notfeylo` (id 229680963), whose noreply address is
# the id-prefixed form below.
#
# History has been rewritten so no commit carries the wrong address, but this
# mapping stays: it keeps `git shortlog`, `git blame` and every tool that reads
# the log resolving to one identity if the wrong address is ever used again.

feylo <229680963+notfeylo@users.noreply.github.com> <feylo@users.noreply.github.com>
